# No secrets belong in this repository.
#
# The assistant uses BYOK: the visitor pastes their Otari key into the chat's
# "AI model settings" panel. That key stays in their browser localStorage and
# is attached only to requests to the selected router. It is never read by the
# build, never written to a file, and never committed.
#
# This file exists only to document that fact. Do not add keys here.
